  "description": "Esteemed developers McGarrell Reilly are pleased to present this ground-floor two-bedroom apartment in Charlemont Square, Dublin 2. Ideally located just a short walk from both Ranelagh and St. Stephen's Green, this A2-rated property offers a spacious, light-filled home finished to an exceptional standard.\n\nAccommodation includes a large, well-proportioned lounge area with expansive floor-to-ceiling windows and access to an external balcony. Off the lounge, the bespoke kitchen features quartz countertops, integrated Siemens appliances, and abundant storage that exceeds typical apartment standards. A separate utility room includes a washing machine, dryer, and built-in shelving.\n\nBoth bedrooms are generously sized with excellent wardrobe space. The luxurious main bathroom and en-suite are fitted with Villeroy & Boch sanitary ware, quartz countertops, rain showers, heated towel rails, and large double-size shower cubicles or bath. Wood flooring and stylish furnishings complete the interior.\n\nThe Development\nThe Locks is Dublin 2's most prestigious new address, set within Charlemont Square—an innovative, mixed-use urban project located between the Grand Canal and Harcourt Street. Seamlessly connecting the surrounding neighbourhoods of Ranelagh, Rathmines, and Portobello, this prime location offers residents city-centre living enhanced by breathtaking views of the mountains, canal, and skyline.\n\nAt the heart of the development is a beautifully designed public plaza, home to a variety of amenities including cafés, restaurants, retail spaces, and a Tesco supermarket. Thoughtfully landscaped, the plaza also features an outdoor playground, exercise equipment, bike racks, and open seating areas.\n\nLocation\nJust minutes from Dublin's premier retail district and fine dining options, The Locks enjoys excellent transport links. The Luas is a three-minute walk away, with numerous bus routes and shared mobility options such as GoCar and City Bikes nearby. Charlemont Square also offers easy access to scenic walking routes along the canal, Iveagh Gardens, and St. Stephen's Green.\n\nResident Features & Amenities\nConcierge and management suite\n\nShared rooftop terraces with panoramic views\n\nParcel collection service\n\nFuture shared car service\n\nBespoke kitchens with quartz countertops and integrated Siemens appliances\n\nSpacious utility rooms with washer/dryer and built-in shelving\n\nFloor-to-ceiling windows to maximise natural light\n\nVilleroy & Boch bathrooms with high-end finishes\n\nStylish furnishings and high-quality flooring throughout\n\nOn-Site Services & Retailers\nKrewe gastro bar\n\nTesco supermarket\n\nMaser Art Studio\n\nHair salon\n\nDry cleaning & housekeeping services\n\nYoga Dublin (opening September)\n\nJackie Tracey Interiors\n\nMcCauley's Pharmacy\n\nSigmoid Golf (golf simulators)\n\nDedicated resident app for Android/iOS\n\nThis exceptional residence redefines urban living—offering luxury, style, and convenience in one of Dublin's most vibrant and connected communities.",
